# R2 — an artifact that does not parse (P2) and one that parses but carries no
# `verdict` (P3) are both counted MISSING, never counted as covered. A reviewer
# that died mid-write must never read as a clean review. stderr carries the
# reason and is discarded here; the caller-visible fact is the MISSING line.
S="$REPO/.claude/scripts/script-eng-review-check.sh"
bash "$S" --reports-dir reports --expect P1,P2,P3 2>/dev/null
